<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS AT ST. PETERSBURG OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS AT ST. PETERSBURG OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>results at the $300,000 St. Petersburg Open men's tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Michael Stich (Germany) beat 8-Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-3 2-6 7-5</p>
<p>7-Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Arnaud Clement (Italy) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
